cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "STMTopRC: A MATLAB package for ground-structure topology optimization of reinforced-concrete strut-and-tie models"
abstract: >-
  STMTopRC is an open-source, case-based, and regression-tested MATLAB
  implementation of the established multi-material and grouped-volume ground-
  structure framework for conceptual strut-and-tie model generation. The package
  separates problem definition from the core solver and supports tie-region and
  tie-angle controls, load-path evaluation, automated reporting, and one-command
  reproduction of the examples. Published benchmarks and component-level tests
  verify the optimizer, state solver, analytical sensitivities, symmetry
  treatment, and load-path calculation. Its explicit equation-to-code mapping,
  executable examples, and self-tests support reproducible research,
  methodological extension, and code-based instruction.
type: software
